{
 "title": "A simpler look: Auctioning one slice of cake",
 "lang": "en",
 "steps": [
  {
   "title": "Clear for a fresh example",
   "say": "Let's put the graph aside and think of an auction for a single slice of cake.",
   "ops": [
    {
     "op": "erase",
     "all": true
    },
    {
     "op": "write",
     "id": "ex_title",
     "x": 60,
     "y": 40,
     "text": "A simpler way: Think of an auction",
     "size": 52
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "Only one buyer",
   "say": "Imagine there is only 1 cake, and only 1 hungry buyer named Alice.",
   "ops": [
    {
     "op": "rect",
     "id": "box_cake",
     "x": 100,
     "y": 240,
     "w": 280,
     "h": 220,
     "color": "blue",
     "fill": "blue"
    },
    {
     "op": "write",
     "id": "txt_cake",
     "x": 240,
     "y": 320,
     "text": "1 Cake\nfor sale",
     "size": 36,
     "anchor": "middle"
    },
    {
     "op": "ellipse",
     "id": "buyer_a",
     "cx": 600,
     "cy": 350,
     "rx": 70,
     "ry": 70,
     "color": "ink"
    },
    {
     "op": "write",
     "id": "txt_buyer_a",
     "x": 600,
     "y": 330,
     "text": "Alice\n($2)",
     "size": 32,
     "anchor": "middle"
    },
    {
     "op": "line",
     "id": "arr_a",
     "x1": 510,
     "y1": 350,
     "x2": 400,
     "y2": 350,
     "arrow": true,
     "width": 4
    },
    {
     "op": "write",
     "id": "res_1",
     "x": 800,
     "y": 330,
     "text": "Alice is the only bidder.\nPrice stays low: $2.",
     "size": 36
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "More buyers arrive",
   "say": "Now 'demand rises' simply means more buyers show up with cash.",
   "ops": [
    {
     "op": "ellipse",
     "id": "buyer_b",
     "cx": 600,
     "cy": 540,
     "rx": 70,
     "ry": 70,
     "color": "red"
    },
    {
     "op": "write",
     "id": "txt_buyer_b",
     "x": 600,
     "y": 520,
     "text": "Bob\n($3)",
     "size": 32,
     "color": "red",
     "anchor": "middle"
    },
    {
     "op": "ellipse",
     "id": "buyer_c",
     "cx": 600,
     "cy": 730,
     "rx": 70,
     "ry": 70,
     "color": "red"
    },
    {
     "op": "write",
     "id": "txt_buyer_c",
     "x": 600,
     "y": 710,
     "text": "Charlie\n($5)",
     "size": 32,
     "color": "red",
     "anchor": "middle"
    },
    {
     "op": "line",
     "id": "arr_b",
     "x1": 510,
     "y1": 520,
     "x2": 400,
     "y2": 410,
     "arrow": true,
     "width": 4,
     "color": "red"
    },
    {
     "op": "line",
     "id": "arr_c",
     "x1": 510,
     "y1": 700,
     "x2": 380,
     "y2": 480,
     "arrow": true,
     "width": 4,
     "color": "red"
    },
    {
     "op": "write",
     "id": "tag_shift",
     "x": 690,
     "y": 620,
     "text": "Demand rises =\nmore buyers!",
     "size": 32,
     "color": "red"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "Bidding war drives price up",
   "say": "They outbid each other to get that one cake. So Charlie wins at $5, driving the price up.",
   "ops": [
    {
     "op": "erase",
     "ids": [
      "res_1"
     ]
    },
    {
     "op": "write",
     "id": "bidding_text",
     "x": 820,
     "y": 280,
     "text": "More buyers fight for\nthe same cake:\n• Alice bids $2\n• Bob bids $3\n• Charlie bids $5",
     "size": 34
    },
    {
     "op": "rect",
     "id": "box_win",
     "x": 820,
     "y": 500,
     "w": 460,
     "h": 140,
     "color": "green",
     "fill": "green"
    },
    {
     "op": "write",
     "id": "txt_win",
     "x": 840,
     "y": 535,
     "text": "Winning Price: $5 (was $2)\nPrice rose because of competition!",
     "size": 30,
     "color": "green"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "title": "The punchline",
   "say": "That's all the demand curve shift is: more total desire chasing limited goods pulls price up.",
   "ops": [
    {
     "op": "write",
     "id": "summary",
     "x": 100,
     "y": 820,
     "text": "Key takeaway: More buyers competing for limited supply forces the price UP.",
     "size": 34,
     "color": "ink"
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}